    "\n  forall A B C E l m t.  Line l /\\  A IN l /\\  E IN l  ==>\n    Line m /\\  B IN m /\\  C IN m  ==>  Line t /\\  A IN t /\\  B IN t  ==>\n    ~(A = E) /\\  ~(B = C) /\\  ~(A = B) /\\  E NOTIN t /\\  C NOTIN t  ==>\n    ~(C,E same_side t)  ==>  angle E A B === angle C B A\n    ==>  l parallel m",
